{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark","doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The grue daemon: each dark turn ticks the counter. The warning prints on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"the first dark turn; dark turns 2…","type":"text"},{"code":"graceTurns + 1","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" are a silent grace;","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"from dark turn "},{"code":"graceTurns + 2","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" on, each turn rolls "},{"code":"chance(lethality)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to be eaten. Stepping back into the light — or "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/suspended","isActive":true},{"text":" — resets the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"count. Guards before the draw, so a lit turn burns no randomness.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"timers"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TimedEventV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"TimedEvent","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/TimedEvent"},{"kind":"text","text":"] { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The warning goes out through ","type":"text"},{"code":"sayOnceThisTurn(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which changes what","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is printed and nothing else: a warning swallowed for repeating the room’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"own dark line is still a warned turn.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The death is always the lingering one, and the line has to say so."}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The counter cannot reach the dice before the third dark turn, so nothing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this daemon kills was killed on the turn it walked into the dark — which"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is the distinction Zork draws with two separate sentences. ","type":"text"},{"code":"V-WALK","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"code":"gverbs.zil:1578","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") says “You have walked into the slavering fangs of a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"lurking grue!” and fires only on a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"blocked"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" move in the dark, a mechanic","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this plugin does not have at all; ","type":"text"},{"code":"GOTO","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (","type":"text"},{"code":"gverbs.zil:2110-2114","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") says","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"“A lurking grue slithered into “ and then the vehicle’s name, or the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"word “room”, “and devoured you!” — and is the one that fits. Both games"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"here had been handed the first. (#350)"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"That branch is why ","type":"text"},{"code":"death","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" takes a subject: the vehicle the player was","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"aboard, or nothing. Both halves are the game’s own words. A library that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"has never seen the game has no business deciding what to call the place","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"somebody was taken from, so the stock line names none.","type":"text"}]}]}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gnustodangerousdark\/dangerousdark\/timers"]}],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"timers","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TimedEventV","text":"TimedEvent","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"title":"timers","modules":[{"name":"GnustoDangerousDark"}],"externalID":"s:19GnustoDangerousDark0bC0V6timersSay0A010TimedEventVGvp","roleHeading":"Instance Property","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"property"},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/timers","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://GnustoDangerousDark/documentation/GnustoDangerousDark/DangerousDark/suspended":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnustodangerousdark\/dangerousdark\/suspended","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"suspended"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"}],"role":"symbol","title":"suspended","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/suspended","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Set while the dark is harmless: the grue idles, draws no randomness,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and — because the count resets on every suspended turn — resuming"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"always begins again at the warning."}]},"doc://GnustoDangerousDark/documentation/GnustoDangerousDark":{"title":"GnustoDangerousDark","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Darkness that 